// ============================================================================
//  mod_wonderweapons.zone - the T5 wonder weapon port (Thundergun, Wunderwaffe
//  DG-2, Winters Howl), merged from SRS_T5_WonderWeapons_portable v1.69.0.
//
//  This file is the packages own manifest verbatim, minus its ">game,T6" line
//  (mod.zone already carries one and a second is a parse error). Its comments
//  are kept deliberately - the package README calls this file, not the README,
//  the source of truth.
//
//  🛑 NO fx ENTRIES, AND THAT IS CORRECT. OpenAssetTools cannot read or write
//  FxEffectDef at all, so a raw .efx is invisible to the Linker - tested and
//  recorded in the starter kit already. The 27 effects these guns need ship as
//  raw .efx inside mod.iwd instead, which is how the donor mod does it: its
//  mod.iwd carries 61 of them and its mod.ff owns just one. Plutonium loads
//  them from the iwd at runtime.
// ============================================================================

