// HUD assets the weapondefs reference that are NOT resident on every enabled map.
// hud_flamethrower_reticle (tesla + thundergun reticleCenter) is scope=top in frontend,
// zm_transit, zm_highrise, zm_buried and zm_tomb but NOT zm_prison or zm_nuked -- which is
// exactly where it rendered as a teal checkerboard. Zoning it copies it from a loaded ff into
// the shared mod.ff, so it resolves everywhere. hud_thundergun is not a stock asset at all;
// its .iwi ships raw, and materials/hud_thundergun.json is authored from hud_tesla.json.
// hud_icon_colt (freezegun) needs nothing -- already scope=top on every map.
// The .iwi was extracted out of frontend.ff with Unlinker --image-format IWI (BUILD RULE 6).
// The Linker cannot pull image DATA from a --load'ed ff, so force-compiling the material
// requires the raw image to exist locally -- the build fails on it otherwise.
image,hud_flamethrower_reticle
material,hud_flamethrower_reticle
image,hud_thundergun
material,hud_thundergun

// ============================================================================
//  🛑 zm_qol ADDITION - THE XANIMS ARE DECLARED EXPLICITLY.
//
//  The package README says the 102 zombie reaction anims "arrive through the
//  animtree, not by name", pulled in as dependencies once each map's
//  anims_<gun>.gsc is linked, and that is why its manifest lists no xanim.
//  MEASURED: THAT DOES NOT HAPPEN HERE. With all 24 .gsc declared and linking
//  cleanly, mod.ff's xanim count did not move - 1549 before, 1549 after. OAT's
//  Linker stores a script as raw text; it does not parse GSC for %anim
//  references, so nothing walks those dummy_anim_ref assignments.
//
//  That matters because this mod ALSO ships the package's MODIFIED
//  animtrees/zm_*_basic.atr and animstatedefs/zm_*_basic.asd, which declare the
//  27 zm_thundergun_fall_* / getup_* states. Shipping those while the anims
//  they name are absent is what crashed Diner survival at load on v1.69.0 -
//  the log stops mid-FX-registration with 0x80000003 and no script error.
//
//  So every xanim the package ships is named here. They resolve from the raw
//  sources in zone_assets\xanim\ (106 files), with the donor fastfile as the
//  fallback for any the raw set is missing.
// ============================================================================
xanim,ai_zombie_crawl_freeze_death_01
xanim,ai_zombie_crawl_freeze_death_02
xanim,ai_zombie_freeze_death_a
