// ============================================================================
//  🛑 zm_qol ADDITION - THE SHELLSHOCK THE PACKAGE FORGOT TO EXPORT.
//
//  _zm_weap_tesla.gsc:31 calls precacheshellshock( "electrocution" ), and the
//  package ships no shock\ folder at all. Precaching a shellshock that is not
//  in any loaded fastfile is a HARD CRASH, not a soft "could not load" - which
//  is exactly what killed Diner survival on v1.69.0 and v1.69.1.
//
//  The log pinpointed it: the last thing to succeed was
//      Loaded fx: maps/zombie/fx_zombie_tesla_neck_spurt
//  which is the final loadfx() in that same init, five lines above the
//  precacheshellshock. Then 0x80000003 with no script error.
//
//  Black Ops 2 does not have this shellshock - BO2-Reimagined's shock\ folder
//  carries only grief_stun_zm and zombie_stun_zm. The donor fastfile does:
//      rawfile, shock/electrocution.shock
//  so it resolves from there, like the techsets and xmodels.
// ============================================================================
rawfile,shock/electrocution.shock

// ============================================================================
//  zm_qol ADDITIONS (v1.73.0) - everything below was measured against the
//  SHIPPED, WORKING build at Wonder_Weapons-T6ZM\wonder_wepons_zm\, which ships
//  the SAME 63 raw .efx in its mod.iwd and does not crash. Diffing its mod.ff
//  against ours produced exactly two gaps.
//
//  1. THIRTEEN TECHNIQUESETS. Seven are effect_* / distortion_* - the shaders
//     particle systems draw with. An fx whose material resolves but whose
//     techniqueset does not is the 0x80000003 at map load. This is the crash.
//  2. LOCALIZE. BO2 ships no entry for any of the six weapon-name keys, which
//     is why the HUD printed ZOMBIE_WEAPON_FREEZEGUN_UPGRADED.
// ============================================================================
localize,mod

